# CLAIM N-2 — does the MFG hierarchical numerator carry a selection factor, and in which channel?

**Status:** DRAFT (research-cycle stage 0 + stage 1). No source edited, no run
launched, no commit. Author of record: Jasper Seehofer — this file claims and
proposes, it decides nothing.

**Question of record** (inherited from
[`.planning/derivation-gfrac-20260805/GATEB_REFUTATION_REPORT.md`](../../../.planning/derivation-gfrac-20260805/GATEB_REFUTATION_REPORT.md)
row N-2, which re-scoped
[`GFRAC_DERIVATION_PACKAGE.md`](../../../.planning/derivation-gfrac-20260805/GFRAC_DERIVATION_PACKAGE.md)
