(`simulation_detection_probability.py:175-179`), what selection factor does the
correct MFG hierarchical numerator carry in **each** channel — and is the current
implementation (which carries **none** in either completion numerator; selection
enters only via the `D̃^φ` normalisation) MFG-correct or defective?

**Derivation companion:**
[`.planning/derivation-gfrac-20260805/N2_SELECTION_NUMERATOR_DERIVATION_20260805.md.DRAFT`](../../../.planning/derivation-gfrac-20260805/N2_SELECTION_NUMERATOR_DERIVATION_20260805.md.DRAFT).

